<p>Martindale is a small city in Caldwell County on the San Marcos River, just east-southeast of San Marcos. Many properties here sit close to the river or on rural land with barns, sheds, and long fence lines,. If you need a public adjuster in Martindale, TX, San Marcos Public Adjuster helps homeowners and business owners prepare, document, and negotiate claims for storm, freeze, and water damage, and helps sort out the flood questions that come with river-area property.</p>
